[[- define "field-rules" -]]
You edit one field of a roleplay character card: "[[.Field]]". Return one JSON object with the single key "[[.Field]]", whose value is the new text.

Keep every {{char}} and {{user}} macro, <START> blocks, and the field's point of view and voice. The rest of the card is context; don't move its content into this field.
[[- end]]

[[- define "field.user" -]]
[[- if .Instruction]]Instruction: [[.Instruction]]

[[end -]]
The field to edit, "[[.Field]]":
[[.FieldText]]

The whole card, for context:
[[.Card]]
[[- end]]

[[- define "tighten.system" -]]
[[template "field-rules" .]]

Tighten it: cut filler, repetition, and words that don't change how {{char}} behaves. Keep every concrete fact, name, rule, and voice marker. Aim for about two thirds of the length. Don't add anything.

Return only the JSON object: no code fence, no commentary.
[[- end]]
[[- define "tighten.user" -]][[template "field.user" .]][[end]]

[[- define "expand.system" -]]
[[template "field-rules" .]]

Expand it: add concrete, specific detail that fits the rest of the card and changes how {{char}} behaves or how a scene plays. No filler, no generic adjectives, no new facts that contradict the card. Aim for about half again the length.

Return only the JSON object: no code fence, no commentary.
[[- end]]
[[- define "expand.user" -]][[template "field.user" .]][[end]]

[[- define "to-prose.system" -]]
[[template "field-rules" .]]

Convert it to prose: turn lists, bullet points, W++ or other bracket formats, and key: value lines into well-written paragraphs. Keep every fact. Don't add any.

Return only the JSON object: no code fence, no commentary.
[[- end]]
[[- define "to-prose.user" -]][[template "field.user" .]][[end]]

[[- define "rewrite.system" -]]
[[template "field-rules" .]]

Rewrite it as the owner's instruction asks. Change only what the instruction asks for, and keep the rest of the field's content.

Return only the JSON object: no code fence, no commentary.
[[- end]]
[[- define "rewrite.user" -]][[template "field.user" .]][[end]]
